            return "Use a mild anti-dandruff shampoo and exfoliate your scalp gently."
        elif problem == 'hairloss':
            return "Use volumizing products to give the appearance of fuller hair and avoid tight hairstyles."
        else:
            return "Consult a professional stylist for other wavy hair problems."

